OL,3,CSea view properties record 27% surge
OL,4,Cin value since 2019, report finds
OL,6,FThe value of a property with a sea
OL,7,Fview in Britain has jumped by more
OL,8,Fthan a quarter since 2019 as buyers
OL,9,Fcontinue to seek out homes by the
OL,10,Fcoast, according to new figures.
OL,12,FRightmove said the average asking
OL,13,Fprice of a house with a view of the
OL,14,Fsea has risen to #298,810, up from
OL,15,F#235,635 in 2019 ` a rise of 27%.
OL,17,FThis has outpaced the national average
OL,18,Fof a 22% increase for British
OL,19,Fproperties during that time.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
