OL,3,CSea view properties record 27% surge
OL,4,Cin value since 2019, report finds
OL,6,FThe East Midlands and Yorkshire and
OL,7,Fthe Humber have seen the biggest
OL,8,Fincreases for sea view homes, with
OL,9,Fgains of 55% and 53% respectively,
OL,10,Faccording to the report.
OL,12,FBut the South East is the most
OL,13,Fexpensive region for a sea view
OL,14,Fproperty, with asking prices now at
OL,15,F#416,375 on average, followed by the
OL,16,FSouth West at #398,764.
OL,18,FScotland is the most affordable region
OL,19,Ffor sea view homes, with an average
OL,20,Fasking price of #166,068, the figures
OL,21,Fshow.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
