OL,3,CSea view properties record 27% surge
OL,4,Cin value since 2019, report finds
OL,6,FWest Mersea in Essex had the biggest
OL,7,Fsea view premium, with an asking price
OL,8,Fof #655,479 on average compared with
OL,9,Fan average coastal value of #433,185
OL,10,Fin the area.
OL,12,FAnother spot in Essex also proved
OL,13,Fappealing to buyers, with Frinton-on-
OL,14,FSea seeing asking prices for homes
OL,15,Fwith a sea view rise 36% when compared
OL,16,Fwith the average on the coast.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
