OL,3,CSea view properties record 27% surge
OL,4,Cin value since 2019, report finds
OL,6,FBuyers in Broadstairs, Kent, pay an
OL,7,Faverage #128,943 extra to have a sea
OL,8,Fview, while in Littlehampton, West
OL,9,FSussex, they pay #120,696 extra an
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,12,FColleen Babcock, Rightmove's property
OL,13,Fexpert, said: "A sea view has long
OL,14,Fbeen seen as one of the most desirable
OL,15,Ffeatures a home can offer, and our
OL,16,Flatest analysis shows buyers are
OL,17,Fwilling to pay a significant premium
OL,18,Ffor one.
