OL,3,CSea view properties record 27% surge
OL,4,Cin value since 2019, report finds
OL,6,F"While some of Britain's most
OL,7,Fprestigious coastal locations continue
OL,8,Fto command the highest prices, we're
OL,9,Falso seeing notable growth in more
OL,10,Faffordable seaside areas, suggesting
OL,11,Fthat sea view homes are becoming
OL,12,Fincreasingly valuable across a wider
OL,13,Frange of the market.
OL,15,F"For buyers, it highlights the
OL,16,Fimportance of considering not just the
OL,17,Fproperty itself, but the lifestyle and
OL,18,Fsetting that come with it."
